  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Season the beef flank steak with salt, black pepper, garlic powder, and paprika.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a skillet over medium-high heat and sear the beef flank steak for 2-3 minutes on each side.",
    "Transfer the skillet to the preheated oven and bake the beef flank steak for 15-20 minutes or until it reaches your desired level of doneness.",
    "While the beef is baking, mix together the chopped parsley, mint, lemon juice, and feta cheese (if using) in a small bowl.",
    "Remove the skillet from the oven and let the beef rest for 5 minutes before slicing it thinly against the grain.",
    "Serve the sliced beef with the parsley-mint mixture spooned over the top.",
    "Garnish with additional parsley and mint if desired."
  ],
